<title>JAPAN: Gunma Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Gunma Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    89.22		vs	  107.18</p>
<p> Operating	   20.16		vs	   18.62</p>
<p> Current		7.06		vs	   11.44</p>
<p> Net		    6.56		vs	    4.36</p>
